cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on Fitrah, please cite it as below."
title: "Fitrah: Hereditary Trust for Autonomous AI Agents"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mehdi
    given-names: Zeeshan
repository-code: "https://github.com/c0ldskin/fitrah"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - agent security
  - hereditary trust
  - delegation
  - capability systems
  - AI governance
abstract: >-
  Fitrah is an experimental research programme exploring whether autonomous
  AI agents can be born with verifiable trust properties that survive learning,
  delegation and reproduction: a child agent inherits a mandatory constitutional
  core and cannot receive more protected authority than its parent may delegate,
  enforced by a trust substrate that works with no language model present.
